  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">About our brand and products:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">Vive Boutique is a trendy online fashion brand focused on western, cowgirl-inspired and stylish outfits. We offer exclusive, limited pieces that help women feel confident, unique, and fashionable.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">What makes us different:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">We focus on limited collections and pre-order drops, meaning each piece is exclusive and sells out fast. Our styles are carefully selected to stay on trend and stand out.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">How affiliates can earn:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">Affiliates earn commission on every sale generated through their personal link and discount code. The more you sell, the more you earn.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">How to promote us:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">You can promote through Instagram, TikTok, and social media by sharing outfit videos, styling ideas, and try-ons. Use your link and code to drive sales.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">Other information:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">We value long-term collaborations and support our affiliates to grow and succeed with us.</span></p></div>",
